      },
      "message": "docs(process): stale claims - second review round\n\n- The stale-claim exception to 'never work a claimed issue' never applies\n  to a P? issue, and points at the rule instead of paraphrasing it.\n- A new claimant over a stale earlier claim: release the stale one first,\n  then mirror the new claim; label and assignee follow the newest live\n  claim.\n- Ended beats live: a comment that withdraws or releases a claim is not\n  activity, and an ended claim is never live again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
